  "description": "***STUNNING REFURBISHED FARMHOUSE*** M&C are delighted to introduce to the market this stunning Old farmhouse full of character & finished to a very high standard. Available to rent for the first time, in the vicinity of Monaleen, located 10 mins from city centre & university and 5 mins from M7 road network. The house consists of kitchen, large dining/sitting room, 3 double bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, utility/office & a large garden with patio & stunning surroundings, picturesque, peaceful and idyllic situated close to a working farm. Very private with private entrance, oil central heating & CCTV. This property is a must see and comes to the market in pristine condition. References are essential before viewing. We expect a lot of interest in this property so please be patient. ***ENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY***",
